            <div type="notes">
                <note xml:id="note1" target="#seg1" type="commentary">On <date when="1917-01-01">1 January 1917</date>, Harriet Weaver sent JJ a telegram telling him that <name type="work" key="W_APORTRAIT">A Portrait of the Artist as a Young Man</name> had appeared in New York published by <name type="person" key="hueb76">B. W. Huebsch</name> (mentioned in her letter to JJ of <date when="1917-01-02">2 January 1917</date>, Firth 166).</note>
